25
00:01:43,192 --> 00:01:46,980
padta hai.

26
00:01:49,380 --> 00:01:52,688
Pachaasi percent transactions sirf do foreign funded

27
00:01:52,688 --> 00:01:55,995
companies control karti hain. Har payment ke

28
00:01:55,995 --> 00:01:59,303
saath aapka GPS location, phone IMEI, aur

29
